msgstr "1.0.0"

msgid "1.2.0"
msgstr "1.2.0"

msgid "Use :class:`~ndict_tools.CompactPathsView` or ``nd.compact_paths()``."
msgstr "Utilisez :class:`~ndict_tools.CompactPathsView` ou ``nd.compact_paths()``."

msgid "``from_dict`` *(free function)*"
msgstr "``from_dict`` *(fonction libre)*"

msgid "1.1.0"
msgstr "1.1.0"

msgid "1.5.0 *(planned)*"
msgstr "1.5.0 *(prévue)*"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Use ``NestedDictionary.from_dict(data, default_setup={...})``."
msgstr "Utilisez ``NestedDictionary.from_dict(data, default_setup={...})``."

msgid "Active deprecations"
msgstr "Dépréciations en cours"

msgid "``from_dict`` free function"
msgstr "Fonction libre ``from_dict``"

msgid ""
"The free function ``from_dict`` (importable from ``ndict_tools.tools``) "
"is deprecated. It will be **removed in 1.5.0** (issue :issue:`81`)."
msgstr ""
"La fonction libre ``from_dict`` (importable depuis ``ndict_tools.tools``)"
" est dépréciée. Elle sera **supprimée en 1.5.0** (issue :issue:`81`)."

msgid ""
"Calling it emits a :class:`DeprecationWarning` with an explicit removal "
"notice."
msgstr ""
"Son appel émet un :class:`DeprecationWarning` avec un avis explicite de "
"suppression."

msgid "Migrate to the classmethod available on all three public classes:"
msgstr ""
"Migrez vers la méthode de classe disponible sur les trois classes "
"publiques :"

msgid "Resolved deprecations"
msgstr "Dépréciations résolues"

msgid ""
"``DictPaths`` was deprecated in 1.0.0 and **removed in 1.2.0** (issue "
":issue:`49`)."
msgstr ""
"``DictPaths`` a été déprécié en 1.0.0 et **supprimé en 1.2.0** (issue "
":issue:`49`)."

msgid ""
"Use :class:`~ndict_tools.CompactPathsView` or call "
":meth:`~ndict_tools.NestedDictionary.compact_paths` on any "
":class:`~ndict_tools.NestedDictionary` instance."
msgstr ""
"Utilisez :class:`~ndict_tools.CompactPathsView` ou appelez "
":meth:`~ndict_tools.NestedDictionary.compact_paths` sur n'importe quelle "
"instance de :class:`~ndict_tools.NestedDictionary`."

